ure/guided-tours-and-events.html\">Guided Tours And Events</a></li><li class=\"item-474\"><a href=\"/en/eifel/leisure/events-calendar.html\">Events Calendar</a></li><li class=\"item-475\"><a href=\"/en/eifel/leisure/geopark-guides-on-site.html\">Geopark Guides On Site</a></li><li class=\"item-476\"><a href=\"/en/eifel/leisure/geopark-host.html\">Geopark Host</a></li><li class=\"item-477\"><a href=\"/en/eifel/leisure/museen-von-a-z-2.html\">Museums From A-Z</a></li><li class=\"item-478\"><a href=\"/en/eifel/leisure/accessible-on-the-road.html\">Accessible On The Road</a></li></ul></div></li><li class=\"item-459 braun deeper dropdown parent\"><h3 class=\"heading\">Hiking and walking</h3><div class=\"dropdown-submenu\" id=\"dmenu4\"><ul><li class=\"item-479\"><a href=\"/en/eifel/hiking-and-walking/overview-of-all-hiking-trails.html\">Overview Of All Hiking Trails</a></li><li class=\"item-480\"><a href=\"/en/eifel/hiking-and-walking/cycling-routes-tours.html\">Cycling Routes &amp; Tours</a></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li class=\"item-460 deeper dropdown parent\"> <a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-toggle\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-target=\"dmenu5\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\" href=\"#\" id=\"dropdownMenuLink_22\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNature and Geopark\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"caret\"></span>\n</a>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"dropdownMenuLink_22\" class=\"dropdown-menu\" id=\"dmenu5\" role=\"navigation\"><ul><li class=\"item-461 blau deeper dropdown parent\"><h3 class=\"heading\">Organisation </h3><div class=\"dropdown-submenu\" id=\"dmenu6\"><ul><li class=\"item-563\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/organisation/sponsors-and-shareholders.html\">Sponsors and Shareholders</a></li><li class=\"item-482\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/organisation/our-team.html\">Our Team</a></li><li class=\"item-483\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/organisation/national-and-international-networks.html\">National And International Networks</a></li></ul></div></li><li class=\"item-462 braun deeper dropdown parent\"><h3 class=\"heading\">Goals and Tasks</h3><div class=\"dropdown-submenu\" id=\"dmenu7\"><ul><li class=\"item-484\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/goals-and-tasks/nature-and-geopark-what-is-it.html\">Nature And Geopark - What Is It?</a></li><li class=\"item-485\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/goals-and-tasks/tasks-and-mission.html\">Tasks and Mission</a></li><li class=\"item-486\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/goals-and-tasks/zenapa-eu-life-projekt-2.html\"> Zenapa EU LIFE Project</a></li><li class=\"item-487\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/goals-and-tasks/sustainability.html\">Sustainability</a></li></ul></div></li><li class=\"item-463 gruen deeper dropdown parent\"><h3 class=\"heading\">Info &amp; Service  </h3><div class=\"dropdown-submenu\" id=\"dmenu8\"><ul><li class=\"item-488\"><a href=\"/en/nature-geopark/info-service/tourist-information.html\">Tourist Information</a></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li class=\"item-464 gruen one-column deeper dropdown parent\"> <a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" class=\"dropdown-toggle\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-target=\"dmenu9\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\" href=\"#\" id=\"dropdownMenuLink_34\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEducation  and Science\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"caret\"></span>\n</a>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"dropdownMenuLink_34\" class=\"dropdown-menu\" id=\"dmenu9\" role=\"navigation\"><ul><li class=\"item-489\"><a href=\"/en/education-and-science/bluehende-vulkaneifel-3.html\">Blooming Vulkaneifel</a></li><li class=\"item-465\"><a href=\"/en/education-and-science/umweltbildungsangebote-2.html\">Education For Sustainable Development</a></li></ul></div></li></ul>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div aria-label=\"Einleitung mit Bild\" class=\"bild deskline-no-article\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"panorama\">\n<div class=\"panorama-text\">\n\n<h2 class=\"tourheading\">On Tour   <span>In The Land  Of Maars And Volcanoes</span> </h2>\n<p class=\"unsichtbar\"> Der nachfolgende IFrame enthält Panoramabilder  eines Drohnenrundfluges über  unsere Vulkaneifel. <a href=\"#artikel_1\">Iframe überspringen</a></p>\n<div class=\"tour-buttons\">\n<button class=\"btn starttour\" onclick=\"startanimation()\"> Start Tour <span class=\"unsichtbar\">3 D Panorama Animation starten</span></button>\n<button class=\"btn stopptour\" onclick=\"stopanimation()\">Stop <span class=\"unsichtbar\">3 D Panorama Animation stoppen</span></button>\n</div></div>\n<img alt=\" Logo Unesco\" id=\"unesco\" src=\"/images/logos/unesco.png\" style=\"max-width:180px\"/>\n<img alt=\" Zeichnung Wildtiere\" id=\"hirsch\" src=\"/images/logos/kulisse_oben.png\"/>\n<iframe id=\"vtbig\" src=\"/karte/angie.html#holzmaar,-50,-45,100\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; \" title=\"Virtuelle Tour\"></iframe>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"contentarea\">\n<main class=\"\">\n<div class=\"landing-page start\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Blog\">\n<!-- <div id=\"_progress\"></div> -->\n<section aria-label=\"ARTIKELS Maare, Urlaub, Wandern\" class=\"introitems\">\n<div class=\"cols-1 row-0 columns bgrow\" style=\";background-color:#ffffff\">\n<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\">\n<article class=\"item center smallbox column-1\" id=\"artikel_1\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h3><span>Our Vulkaneifel</span>Nature Park and UNESCO Global Geopark</h3>\n<div class=\"strich\"> </div>\n<p>Between Bad Bertrich near the Moselle and Ormont on the Belgian border stretches an exceptional and exciting part of our earth's surface. The “volcanism adventure” takes shape here, attracting guests as well as scientists from all over the world.</p>\n<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en/nature-geopark/goals-and-tasks/nature-and-geopark-what-is-it.html\"> more Infos</a></p>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"cols-1 row-1 columns bgrow\">\n<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\">\n<article class=\"item col-12 column-1\" id=\"artikel_2\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Maars and long distance views</h2>\n\n<div class=\"mod_articles_category__scroller\" id=\"module_389\">\n<ul class=\"snap-slider\">\n<li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-1\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEifel View Hasenberg\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Hasenberg Hütte mit Friedenskreuz\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/ausblicke/Hasenberg_Aussicht.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n From the Eifel view Hasenberg you can see the Kylltal. The southern foothills of the Dollendorfer Kalkmulde can be seen between the Kylltal and the Baasem/Dahlem Forest. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/long-distance-views/eifel-blick-hasenberg.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Eifel View...\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> <li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-2\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEifel View Leudersdorf\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"11 Dörfer Blick Leudersdorf\" class=\"caption\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/ausblicke/eb_leudersdorf_1.webp\" title=\"Liegesofa am Eifel-Blick © Natur- und Geopark Vulkaneifel GmbH, I. Sartoris\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Eifel view Leudersdorf offers hikers an extensive panorama. You have a direct view of Leudersdorf, a district of Üxheim in the Hillesheimer Land, all the way to the Ahütte industrial area in...\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/long-distance-views/eifel-blick-leudersdorf.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Eifel View...\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> <li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-3\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tImmerather Maar\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Immerather Maar von oben\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/maare/immerathermaar/immerather_maar_von_oben.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA maar lake without an inflow - the water is replenished exclusively by precipitation, surface and groundwater. In the diverse and extremely fertile habitat, rich plants thrive and numerous...\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/maars-and-crater-lakes/immerather-maar.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Immerather Maar\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> <li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-4\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tObservation Tower Landesblick\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Aussichtsturm Landesblick mit Eifel-Blick\" class=\"caption\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/ausblicke/eb_meerfeld_2.webp\" title=\"© Natur- und Geopark Vulkaneifel GmbH, Kappest\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n This viewing point above the Meerfelder Maar is unique. From the edge of the crater you have a picturesque view of the Mosenberg, Meerfeld and the Meerfelder Maar. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/long-distance-views/aussichtsturm-landesblick.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Observation...\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> <li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-5\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEifel View Belvedere\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Eifel-Blick Belvedere\" class=\"caption\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/ausblicke/Eifelblick-Belvedere_2_NGP_ISartoris.webp\" title=\"© Natur- und Geopark Vulkaneifel GmbH, I. Sartoris\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n Hikers have a magnificent view of the deep Liesertal, the Manderscheid castles and the town of Manderscheid on the other side of the valley. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/long-distance-views/eifel-blick-belvedere.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Eifel View...\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> <li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-6\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGemündener Maar\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Gemündener Maar mit Wanderer\" class=\"caption\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/maare/gemuendenermaar/gemuendener_mit_wanderer.webp\" title=\"Gemndener Maar © Natur- und Geopark Vulkaneifel GmbH, Kappest\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGemündener Maar, with a diameter of 325 meters, is the smallest of the three Daun Maars. It was named after the Daun district of Gemünden and is located approximately 1.5 kilometers from the...\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/maars-and-crater-lakes/gemuendener-maar.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Gemündener Maar\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> <li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-7\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEifel View Semersberg\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Eifel-Blick Semersberg\" class=\"caption\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/ausblicke/eb_semersberg_header.webp\" title=\"Blick auf Darscheid © Natur- und Geopark Vulkaneifel GmbH, I. Sartoris\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n At the Eifel view Semersberg you not only have a beautiful view of the town of Darscheid, but on a clear day you also have an extremely wide view. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/long-distance-views/eifel-blick-semersberg.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Eifel View...\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> <li class=\"slideitem\" id=\"item-8\">\n<h4 class=\"linked\">\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJungferweiher\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Jungferweiher \" class=\"caption\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/389/600/images/maare/jungfernweiher/jungfernweiher1.webp\" title=\"Jungferweiher © Natur- und Geopark Vulkaneifel GmbH, Kappest\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<p class=\"category-module-flex-introtext\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNorth of the Ulmener Maar lies the Jungferweiher. It fills a shallow depression sloping towards the south. This previously silted up, older dry maar was flooded again in 1942 by damming the...\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n<p class=\"category-module-flexreadmore\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/maars-and-crater-lakes/jungferweiher.html\">\n<span class=\"unsichtbar\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead more:                     Jungferweiher\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</li> </ul>\n<button class=\"snap-prev arrow left-arrow\" id=\"module_389_left\"> <span class=\"\">PREV</span></button>\n<button class=\"snap-next arrow right-arrow\" id=\"module_389_right\"> <span class=\"\">NEXT</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"cols-1 row-2 columns bgrow\">\n<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\">\n<article class=\"item col-12 column-1\" id=\"artikel_3\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">What There Is To Discover</h2>\n<p>\n<ul class=\"category-module-flexitems\">\n<li class=\"content-image\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/protected-areas/naturparke.html\">\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"Naturpark-Landschaft\" class=\"caption\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/390/600/images/naturschutz/NP_KPK.jpg\" title=\"Naturpark-Landschaft © Natur- und Geopark Vulkaneifel GmbH, Kappest\" width=\"600\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<h4> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVulkaneifel Nature Park\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n</div></a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"content-image\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/protected-areas/landschaftsschutz.html\">\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/390/600/images/ffh/maare/pulvermaar.jpg\" width=\"600\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex-text\">\n<h4> \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLandscape Protection\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n</div></a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"content-image\">\n<a class=\"category-module-flex-title\" href=\"/en/eifel/landscape/protected-areas/ffh-gebiete.html\">\n<div class=\"item-image\">\n<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/cache/mod_articles_category/390/600/images/landschaft/vonoben.jpg\" width=\"600\"/>\n<